  "body": "> To shorten a url’s path:\r\n> 1. Let path be url’s path.\r\n> 1. If path is empty, then return.\r\n> 1. If url’s scheme is \"file\", path’s size is 1, and path[0] is a normalized Windows drive letter, then return.\r\n> 1. Remove path’s last item.\r\n\r\nSince all the operations are done on the variable _path_, rather than on _url_'s path, the results get thrown away.",
